-- LibItemDB raid / world / self buff auras - WoW TBC (locale-independent)
-- Auto-generated by tools/build-aura-buffs.py from wago.tools DB2. Do not hand-edit.
-- The stats every RANK of a buff grants, keyed by spellID, in the stat vocabulary gear
-- uses (plus a PCT_<STAT> vocabulary for percent buffs). The DB is complete (all ranks)
-- and a consumer serves whichever it wants. Buff NAMES are the only curation; only item
-- buffs (scrolls / flasks / food) are out of scope — those live in Effects.lua by itemID.
-- Field 4 is the mutual-exclusion SLOT (GetAuraGroup / the exclGroup field): two buffs
-- sharing a token cannot both be active. One field per slot in the WoWSims buff protos
-- (MIT, github.com/wowsims) — this version's own model first, then wowsims/classic for a
-- buff its own does not name, which is sound only because every such buff is the SAME
-- spell id on every version. EMPTY means no WoWSims model names a slot for it — read
-- that as unknown, never as 'stacks with everything'.
-- client build 2.5.6.68941 - 140 buff ranks
-- source wowsims/tbc-new master tarball sha256:201082fc0875
-- source wowsims/classic master tarball sha256:7990b4218da5

